# VelnorLabs org .github CODEOWNERS
# This file governs the .github org repo (shared workflows, org-level templates).
#
# Q-2 ownership rules (Invariant §5, plan §2.5):
#   external/* OpenAPI schemas  → @VelnorLabs/pm
#   internal/* OpenAPI schemas  → @VelnorLabs/engineering
#   cross-tier/* OpenAPI schemas → @VelnorLabs/pm + @VelnorLabs/engineering
#
# Org .github shared files default to engineering review.

# Default: all changes require engineering review
*                                               @VelnorLabs/engineering

# Shared CI/CD workflows — infra-leads must co-approve
.github/workflows/                              @VelnorLabs/engineering @VelnorLabs/infra-leads

# Security policy
SECURITY.md                                     @VelnorLabs/engineering @VelnorLabs/infra-leads

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Schema tier gates (Q-2 / T-W1-018)
# These patterns apply when velnor-schemas CODEOWNERS is stamped from the
# codeowners-templates/CODEOWNERS.schemas template.  They are mirrored here
# so the .github org repo itself enforces the same rules on template changes.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# External (customer-facing) OpenAPI schemas — PM must review (24h SLA)
codeowners-templates/CODEOWNERS.schemas         @VelnorLabs/pm @VelnorLabs/engineering

# Schema bypass-check and SLA-watch workflows — infra-leads + PM gate
.github/workflows/_schema-bypass-check.yml      @VelnorLabs/engineering @VelnorLabs/infra-leads @VelnorLabs/pm
.github/workflows/_schema-sla-watch.yml         @VelnorLabs/engineering @VelnorLabs/infra-leads @VelnorLabs/pm
